</table>
<p id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">We next find <math id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(\bm{x},R)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\bm{x},R)</annotation></semantics></math> again by summing/integrating out other variables and setting <math id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y=R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y=R</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
