</table>
<p id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p5.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p5.3.1" class="ltx_text">where in Equation <a href="#A3.E43" title="Equation 43 ‣ Proof. ‣ Lemma C.1. ‣ C.1 Proof of Proposition ‣ Appendix C Proofs ‣ Self-Speculative Masked Diffusions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">43</span></a> we have used the fact that <math id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\hat{\bm{x}}}\text{max}(0,\overset{\leftrightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}})-\overset{\rightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}}))=\sum_{\hat{\bm{x}}}\text{max}(0,\overset{\rightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}})-\overset{\leftrightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></msub><mrow><mtext>max</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">↔</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></msub><mrow><mtext>max</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">→</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">↔</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\hat{\bm{x}}}\text{max}(0,\overset{\leftrightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}})-\overset{\rightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}}))=\sum_{\hat{\bm{x}}}\text{max}(0,\overset{\rightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}})-\overset{\leftrightarrow}{p}(\hat{\bm{x}}))</annotation></semantics></math>. This can be seen through the following manipulations,</span></p>
